@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Create Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Event 3",
  "description": "Desc 3",
  "location": "Loc 3",
  "dateTime": "2026-01-01T15:11:00.000Z"
}


### Get Events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events


### Get Event
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/1


### Update Event
PUT {{baseUrl}}/events/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "updated Event 3",
  "description": "Desc 3",
  "location": "Loc 3",
  "dateTime": "2026-01-01T15:11:00.000Z"
}


### Delete Event
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/3


### Signup user
POST {{baseUrl}}/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sample@gmail.com",
  "password": "123"
}